-*   **Hairball Scene Performance:** In floating-point buffers, the Hairball scene (2.88M triangles) performs poorly (<2x better than Schwarz and Seidel 2010) at high resolutions [S1]. This is due to:
-    1.  Limited tile size ($16^3$) increasing coarse raster work (sorting more triangle/tile pairs) [S1].
